- src/scripts/promote-intake.js: intake_queue 'new' rows -> assets, catalog artist spelling,
  full museum title + year, daily/per-run caps, stops if the intake folder isn't shared
- cron.js: hourly job, does nothing unless INTAKE_PROMOTE_ON=1
- drive-watcher.js + missing-files.js: promoted files sit outside the main root, so the
  full scan no longer treats them as missing

